<title>USA: McHenry Cty CCSD No. 158, Ill., won by Dain.</title>
<headline>McHenry Cty CCSD No. 158, Ill., won by Dain.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dain Bosworth  said it won $7 million of McHenry and Kane Cos Community Consolidated Sch Dist No. 158, Ill., general obligation school building bonds, with a net interest cost of 5.47 percent.</p>
